  "intranetText": "<p><strong>ORDEM DO DIA</strong></p>\n<p><strong>10H00</strong></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><strong>1 - Discuss&atilde;o de artigos remetidos a Plen&aacute;rio e normas avocadas</strong></p>\n<p><strong>Tempos</strong><br><strong>5 minutos ao Governo, a cada GP e DURP</strong></p>\n<p><br><strong>2 - Vota&ccedil;&otilde;es</strong></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><strong>3- Encerramento do debate na especialidade do Or&ccedil;amento do Estado para 2027</strong></p>\n<p><strong><a href=\"http://www.parlamento.pt/ActividadeParlamentar/Paginas/DetalheIniciativa.aspx?BID=377352\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Proposta de Lei n.&ordm; 110/XVII/2.&ordf; (GOV)</a></strong></p>\n<p>Or&ccedil;amento do Estado para 2027</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<table class=\"grelha\" style=\"width: 60%; margin-left: auto; margin-right: auto;\" border=\"1\" cellspacing=\"0\" cellpadding=\"4\">\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"text-align: center;\" colspan=\"2\">\n<p><strong>Debate na Especialidade</strong></p>\n<p><strong>ENCERRAMENTO</strong></p>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"text-align: center;\">JPP</td>\n<td style=\"text-align: center;\">3 m</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"text-align: center;\">PAN</td>\n<td style=\"text-align: center;\">3 m</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"text-align: center;\">BE</td>\n<td style=\"text-align: center;\">3 m</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"text-align: center;\">CDS-PP</td>\n<td style=\"text-align: center;\">6 m</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"text-align: center;\">PCP</td>\n<td style=\"text-align: center;\">6 m 30</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"text-align: center;\">L</td>\n<td style=\"text-align: center;\">7 m 30</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"text-align: center;\">IL</td>\n<td style=\"text-align: center;\">8 m 30</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"text-align: center;\">PS</td>\n<td style=\"text-align: center;\">12 m 30</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"text-align: center;\">CH</td>\n<td style=\"text-align: center;\">13 m 30</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"text-al